      "COMET is the first randomised evidence that low-risk DCIS can be monitored rather than operated on, at least in the short term; LORIS and LORD will add longer follow-up.",
      "Genomic assays and validated clinicopathological criteria let many women omit radiotherapy after lumpectomy.",
      "Hypofractionated and partial-breast radiotherapy shorten treatment for those who need it; low-dose tamoxifen cuts side effects.",
